{"id":5294,"date":"2025-08-29T09:00:24","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T09:00:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5294"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:12:21","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:12:21","slug":"cach-livestream-tren-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-livestream-tren-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch livestream tr\u00ean Shopee \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"XGzUdHbqio3phUx7vnAlNZ2mgzf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HbSpdKDSdo3I7NxQXDOltAewgbd\">C\u00e1ch livestream b\u1eb1ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh tr\u00ean Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 m\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 mong ch\u1edd <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p nh\u1ea5t khi ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nh\u1eefng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n kinh doanh tr\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T. B\u1edfi l\u1ebd \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean s\u00e0n t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n. V\u00ec th\u1ebf, \u1edf b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0a ra h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft t\u1eeb A-Z v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch live tr\u00ean Shopee.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GEMXddu2BoPAIix9PXAl6FdogAf\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi livestream tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EuxndHCuyou9GdxEquRlWwrMgOb\">S\u1ef1 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ebfn 70% th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i livestream. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng v\u1edbi 3 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 sau:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FW8gdNJLUoCKQ6xZ8U3ldbV8ggd\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-AR79dzPHqoheL4xRK2NlyUoZgCg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8d32e2e7-1d81-4dcf-b7c4-8bb4e75208a5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FB5shbgywfonWrpxzC4ml1gHPgFe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;B5shbgywfonWrpxzC4ml1gHPgFe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:888201,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8d32e2e7-1d81-4dcf-b7c4-8bb4e75208a5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FB5shbgywfonWrpxzC4ml1gHPgFe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;B5shbgywfonWrpxzC4ml1gHPgFe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:888201,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5295\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5295\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5295\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8.png\" alt=\"Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb khi livestream tr\u00ean Shopee\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f6a219ba-25a1-418b-82a1-fc94c55ecdb8-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5295\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb khi livestream tr\u00ean Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"XGzUdHbqio3phUx7vnAlNZ2mgzf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NWuoddaH1oh159x5UJSlWI5CgBh\">B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb qu\u00e1 \u0111\u1eaft ti\u1ec1n, nh\u01b0ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U13jdprDgoXOCzx6YValAHawgGc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng minh:<\/strong> \u01afu ti\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u00f3 camera s\u1eafc n\u00e9t \u0111\u1ec3 cho ra h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EoiSdbXTmoBLDmxLv9PlryBBg2g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ee1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i (Tripod):<\/strong> C\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh, ch\u1ed1ng rung l\u1eafc v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u00f3c quay chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G6S6dbEfIodmDzxSxthlsmcugmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u00c1nh s\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7:<\/strong> \u00c1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ed1t s\u1ebd gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n livestream (\u0111\u00e8n ring light).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DcWRdiZXUoh6H7xqgptl26dkgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i Internet \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh:<\/strong> M\u1ea1ng Wifi m\u1ea1nh ho\u1eb7c 4G\/5G t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 cao l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng gi\u1eadt, lag hay m\u1ea5t k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i gi\u1eefa ch\u1eebng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P1y1dj4eeoJBKXxNYiml23vYgGc\">N\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 h\u01a1n, c\u00e1c shop ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb 1 studio live ri\u00eang cho m\u00ecnh v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb camera, \u0111\u00e8n,&#8230; chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tj9VdjFd8oWsffxt3HTltPrcgYe\">\u0110\u1ec3 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t phi\u00ean live chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1ea5t m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 nhi\u1ec1u chi ph\u00ed ban \u0111\u1ea7u, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cho thu\u00ea studio v\u00e0 host livestream<\/a><\/strong>. C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng cung c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng gian chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft nh\u01b0 PC c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh m\u1ea1nh, camera ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u00e8n v\u00e0 micro chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkFwd1V8Tom8WqxpZoZlnWoyg0c\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-TL2Hdjl97ofESIx7UQclYyVvg2f\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;58c3e3a0-e086-49fa-9639-6f6f23360524&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP6wwb8yU1of5Gyxa2IKlSnRRgUd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P6wwb8yU1of5Gyxa2IKlSnRRgUd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:788989,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;58c3e3a0-e086-49fa-9639-6f6f23360524&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP6wwb8yU1of5Gyxa2IKlSnRRgUd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P6wwb8yU1of5Gyxa2IKlSnRRgUd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:788989,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n