a-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khi \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng, nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat &#8220;<strong>Ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp<\/strong>&#8220;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KfONdHbxgoidmBxGJtbl5AWmgHg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong khi live, h\u00e3y l\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi c\u00e1c thao t\u00e1c c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ecdc b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, ghim s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111ang gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u l\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh, v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Me1BdAdyAocskXxObval77uWgnf\">C\u00e1c m\u1eb9o \u0111\u1ec3 livestream hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GvJ6d4gzxooaKrxOM9ilCesHgW6\">M\u1eb9o t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LT2rdsxyvoPRyuxroralRytjgMc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Lu\u00f4n ch\u00e0o h\u1ecfi:<\/strong> Ch\u00e0o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc t\u00ean nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem m\u1edbi v\u00e0o phi\u00ean live \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGCLdnI41o6vixx6csdliCeJgYb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1eb7t c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi:<\/strong> \u0110\u1eb7t c\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi m\u1edf \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O31sdYVyYoClnRxyNmZlmpAkgkg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c Mini-game:<\/strong> C\u00e1c tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 &#8220;\u0111o\u00e1n gi\u00e1&#8221;, &#8220;chia s\u1ebb nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0&#8221; s\u1ebd gi\u00fap gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GBxxdQj98o0nDMxvbFtlogXYgrd\">M\u1eb9o v\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0B0dczkHo4YnuxOjNxlvgUagXb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u00f3i v\u1ec1 l\u1ee3i \u00edch, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng:<\/strong> Thay v\u00ec n\u00f3i &#8220;chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o n\u00e0y l\u00e0m t\u1eeb v\u1ea3i cotton&#8221;, h\u00e3y n\u00f3i &#8220;chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o n\u00e0y m\u1eb7c v\u00e0o r\u1ea5t m\u00e1t v\u00e0 th\u1ea5m m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho m\u00f9a h\u00e8&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KAAfdHhjFoGVEQxstuulo0Peg8f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u00e2n th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng:<\/strong> H\u00e3y l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh m\u00ecnh, gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 lu\u00f4n gi\u1eef th\u00e1i \u0111\u1ed9 vui v\u1ebb, tr\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7y n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ksymd55GMod0xBxxnK5lesGZgYe\">M\u1eb9o k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrZIdRHNFoLHM0xFjPHlOaxPgAe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi live:<\/strong> M\u1edf camera v\u00e0 micro tr\u01b0\u1edbc 5-10 ph\u00fat \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWx2dfkNdoH4UgxjZhKl16Xpgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 th\u1ec3, h\u00e3y nh\u1edd m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi c\u00e1c b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c n\u00f3i tr\u01b0\u1edbc camera.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UDlQdQ3gPoD1naxj4DNl3lYLgzd\">X\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi livestream<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DcAUdtNz7oSbKhxJDDcl3uGtggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u00cdt ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem:<\/strong> \u0110\u1eebng n\u1ea3n l\u00f2ng! H\u00e3y th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o l\u1ecbch live tr\u01b0\u1edbc tr\u00ean c\u00e1c k\u00eanh m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i, v\u00e0 trong l\u00fac live h\u00e3y ki\u00ean tr\u00ec k\u00eau g\u1ecdi m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi chia s\u1ebb \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat th\u00eam ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZgTda5JKogVISx2L2RlwLtHgm7\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1ecb ng\u1eaft k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu m\u1ea1ng y\u1ebfu, h\u00e3y b\u00ecnh t\u0129nh k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem tr\u00ean trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a shop.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ua82dhEo3oEC4yxQiwplM5sag1c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>G\u1eb7p c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi kh\u00f3:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu g\u1eb7p c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi, h\u00e3y th\u00e0nh th\u1eadt n\u00f3i r\u1eb1ng b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi sau, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o chuy\u1ec3n sang ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BBXodblNfoI3cgxnJbolVVWOgfk\">Livestream tr\u00ean Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi v\u00e0 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng. \u0110\u1eebng s\u1ee3 sai hay kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ai xem \u1edf nh\u1eefng l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. H\u00e3y m\u1ea1nh d\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c h\u00e0nh, t\u00f3m t\u1eaft l\u1ea1i quy tr\u00ecnh v\u00e0 r\u00fat kinh nghi\u1ec7m sau m\u1ed7i phi\u00ean live. Ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn r\u1eb1ng, v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 ki\u00ean tr\u00ec v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng, livestream s\u1ebd tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 doanh s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trung th\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMkqdcKvaovatYxKODGl14m9gCx\">Khi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 th\u00e0nh th\u1ea1o nh\u1eefng k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, vi\u1ec7c n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed s\u1ebd l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u1ebfp theo. \u0110\u1ec3 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u1eeb c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"XGzUdHbqio3phUx7vnAlNZ2mgzf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZutBdPDpponG7Mxefg9lyeEIgfd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lw00d7lBHoMjomxLHVJlDoXSgTd\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TmMcdyLGpoEgJRx8crWlujM9ggb\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LFRfdKtFQo58aUxGaYdl9WDYgff\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G9dadPNLeoY8kfxcdNklswVogEe\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TtRCduHSAotE6wxXFaGl3rsNgwb\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><stro